  "details": "Hey! I was thinking of a neat idea that would aid a lot of people with preventing Avatar Ripping! \nOkay so,\nImagine if you could set a Public Avatar, almost like a Fallback avatar, except only non-friends can see it! so- People you aren't friends with will only see you using a Public avatar while on yours and your friends end they'll see you in your private avatar!\nI feel this would truly help a lot of people and make the chance of being ripped smaller while traveling around to public worlds and at the same time make people feel more safer as they can on their end wear their own avatar while knowing that others that are strangers to you can't see or steal your avatar c:",
